{"content/designers/anna-sposa.json":{"name":"Anna Sposa","origin":"Ukraine","founded":2014,"price":"$2,000 – $3,500","plus":false,"line":"Romance, made comfortable.","intro":"From one of Ukraine’s most established bridal ateliers, Anna Sposa is known for hand-placed lace, airy tulle and silhouettes cut to move — romantic gowns that are a pleasure to wear from the ceremony to the last dance.","note":"Lace, light and movement — the collection brides fall for in the mirror.","hero":"/media-source/gowns/anna-sposa--hypnolia--0.jpg","feature":["/media-source/gowns/anna-sposa--konstantsia--0.jpg","/media-source/gowns/anna-sposa--maritam--0.jpg","/media-source/gowns/anna-sposa--brandeis--0.jpg"],"order":2},"content/designers/dama-couture.json":{"name":"DAMA Couture","origin":"Warsaw, Poland","founded":"","price":"$2,500 – $3,500","plus":false,"line":"Luxury, on your own terms.","intro":"Designed in Warsaw, DAMA Couture believes true luxury is shining in your own way rather than following expectations. Expect sculpted bodices, dimensional florals and sun-warmed, editorial glamour.","note":"Confident and sensual — for the bride with a strong point of view.","hero":"/media-source/gowns/dama-couture--claire--0.jpg","feature":["/media-source/gowns/dama-couture--margo--0.jpg","/media-source/gowns/dama-couture--procella--0.jpg","/media-source/gowns/dama-couture--nabila--0.jpg"],"order":3},"content/designers/eva-lendel.json":{"name":"Eva Lendel","origin":"Lviv, Ukraine","founded":2015,"price":"$3,000 – $6,000","plus":true,"line":"Bespoke tailoring, modern line.","intro":"Founded in Lviv in 2015, Eva Lendel pairs classic couture construction with a decidedly modern eye: sculpted corsetry, clean satins, detachable sleeves and overskirts that let one gown become two.","note":"Our most fashion-forward house — for the bride who wants the gown people talk about.","hero":"/media-source/gowns/eva-lendel--jess--0.jpg","feature":["/media-source/gowns/eva-lendel--palace--0.jpg","/media-sour