private bridal salon outside Kalamazoo. We carry a tightly edited collection of European gowns — chosen for their construction, their detail and the way they move — and we show them one bride at a time.","No crowded showroom. No rush. Just you, the people you love, and a stylist whose only job that afternoon is you."],"link":{"label":"Our story","href":"/about/"},"imageA":{"key":"s/boutique-display","alt":"A lace gown displayed on a form beside a wall of white flowers inside La Soirée Bridal","pos":"50% 40%"},"imageB":{"key":"s/boutique-bodice","alt":"Close view of a beaded lace bodice on the boutique rail"}},{"id":"pillars","type":"pillars","eyebrow":"The La Soirée experience","headline":["Three things","we never *compromise.*"],"items":[{"numeral":"I","title":"Private","body":"Appointments are scheduled so the salon revolves around one bride — never a crowded showroom floor.","image":{"key":"s/boutique-interior","alt":"The salon floor at La Soirée Bridal with chandeliers and gowns on brass rails","pos":"45% 50%"}},{"numeral":"II","title":"Curated","body":"European houses chosen for construction, detail and something you won’t see in every other shop.","image":{"key":"s/boutique-rack","alt":"Lace and tulle gowns hanging on the boutique rail","pos":"50% 30%"}},{"numeral":"III","title":"Personal","body":"A dedicated stylist, the gowns you choose plus a few she knows you shouldn’t miss.","image":{"key":"s/boutique-florals","alt":"Pink and blush florals arranged on a white console in the boutique","pos":"50% 55%"}}]},{"id":"collection","type":"collection-rail","eyebrow":"The collection","headline":["Gowns with a","*point of view.*"],"body":"Sculpted satin, hand-placed lace, overskirts that turn one gown into two. Most of our gowns are $2,500–$3,000; the full range is $1,500–$6,000.","railLabel":"Featured gowns","gowns":["jess","hypnolia","margo","cordelia","palace","konstantsia","claire","rosario","lika","savina","procella","elison"],"cta":{"label":"Explore the collection","href":"/collection/"}},{"id":"designers","type":"designer-index","eyebrow":"Our designers","headline":["From Europe,","with *intention.*"],"body":"Five houses from Ukraine and Poland — chosen for artistry, fit and fabric rather than volume."},{"id":"appointment","type":"appointment-feature","eyebrow":"Your appointment","headline":["Your appointment.","Your people.","Your *moment.*"],"lede":"Bring the people whose opinion matters. Choose eight to twelve gowns from the salon, and let your stylist add the few she knows you shouldn’t leave without trying.","facts":[{"big":"1","label":"Dedicated stylist"},{"big":"4","label":"Guests welcome"},{"big":"1–2","unit":" hrs","label":"Unhurried time"}],"primaryCta":{"label":"Book your appointment","href":"/book/","track":"appointment_section"},"secondaryCta":{"label":"What to expect","href":"/experience/"},"image":{"key":"s/boutique-salon","alt":"","pos":"50% 55%"}},{"id":"vip","type":"vip-teaser","eyebrow":"The Champagne VIP","headline":["Make an","afternoon *of it.*"],"lede":"The entire boutique, closed to everyone but you and your party. Champagne poured, two unhurried hours, every gown within reach.","facts":[{"term":"Champagne","detail":"poured for your party"},{"term":"You + 6","detail":"guests"},{"term":"The boutique","detail":"reserved entirely for you"},{"term":"2 hours","detail":"· $125"}],"cta":{"label":"Explore VIP appointments","href":"/vip/"},"backgroundImage":{"key":"s/chandelier","alt":""},"image":{"key":"s/champagne","alt":"Champagne glasses raised in a toast"}},{"id":"proof","type":"proof","eyebrow":"In their words","srHeading":"What brides say about La Soirée","image":{"key":"s/boutique-rack-ivory","alt":"Ivory lace gowns on the boutique rail","pos":"50% 40%"},"instagramLabel":"Our brides on Instagram"},{"id":"salon","type":"salon-mosaic","eyebrow":"The salon","headline":["A bridal salon designed","to feel entirely *yours.*"],"body":"3,000 square feet of light, chandeliers and gowns on brass rails — with private dressing rooms and a lounge for the people you bring.","images":[{"key":"s/boutique-lounge","alt":"The guest lounge: tufted white armchair, sofa and a marble table with blush flowers"},{"key":"s/boutique-flowers","alt":"Blush flowers and a gown displayed in the boutique"},{"key":"s/boutique-rail","alt":"A rail of embellished ivory gowns"},{"key":"s/acc-pearls","alt":"Pearl and crystal bridal hair accessories on a glass shelf"},{"key":"s/boutique-gowns","alt":"Ivory gowns hanging side by side"}],"footNote":"minutes from Kalamazoo and Portage · about an hour from Grand Rapids","link":{"label":"Plan your visit","href":"/contact/"}},{"id":"journal","type":"journal-teaser","eyebrow":"The journal","headline":["Before you *visit.*"],"allLink":{"label":"All articles","href":"/journal/"},"posts":["wedding-dress-shopping-guide","wedding-gowns-based-on-venue","bridal-alterations"]},{"id":"final-cta","type":"final-cta","eyebrow":"Open by appointment","headline":["Your dress","is *waiting.*"],"image":{"key":"s/editorial-staircase","alt":"","pos":"68% 50%"},"primaryCta":{"label":"Book your appointment","href":"/book/","track":"final_cta"},"secondaryCta":{"label":"Ask us a question","href":"/contact/"}}]},"content/settings/appointments.json":{"appointments":[{"id":"vip","name":"The Champagne VIP","square":"2 Hour VIP Appointment with Champagne","price":125,"minutes":120,"guests":6,"lines":["The entire boutique, reserved for you","Champagne for you and your guests","You + up to 6 guests","Two unhurried hours"],"featured":true},{"id":"two-hour","name":"The Two-Hour Appointment","square":"2 Hour Appointment (No Champagne)","price":50,"minutes":120,"guests":4,"lines":["A dedicated stylist","You + up to 4 guests","Time to try every silhouette"]},{"id":"one-hour","name":"The One-Hour Appointment","square":"1 Hour Appointment","price":25,"minutes":60,"guests":4,"lines":["A dedicated stylist","You + up to 4 guests","Ideal if you know what you love"]},{"id":"return","name":"Return Visit","square":"Other Appointment (Dress pickup | 2nd appt)","price":0,"minutes":30,"guests":null,"lines":["Second look, gown purchase or dress pickup"]}]},"content/settings/business.json":{"name":"La Soirée Bridal","legalName":"La Soiree Bridal","url":"https://lasoireebridal.com","phone":"269-220-0440","phoneHref":"tel:+12692200440","email":"hello@lasoireebridal.com","address":{"street":"8880 N 32nd Street","suite":"Suite 1","city":"Richland","region":"MI","regionLong":"Michigan","zip":"49083","country":"US"},"geo":{"lat":42.38921,"lng":-85.454659},"mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=8880+N+32nd+Street+Suite+1+Richland+MI+49083","opened":"2022-09-01","hours":[{"days":["Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday"],"opens":"10:00","closes":"21:30","label":"Tuesday – Friday","time":"10 am – 9:30 pm"},{"days":["Saturday"],"opens":"10:00","closes":"19:00","label":"Saturday","time":"10 am – 7 pm"},{"days":["Sunday"],"opens":"10:00","closes":"16:00","label":"Sunday","time":"10 am – 4 pm"},{"days":["Monday"],"closed":true,"label":"Monday","time":"Closed"}],"priceRange":"$1,500 – $6,000","booking":{"page":"/book/","squareServices":"https://book.squareup.com/appointments/qbvq4uh8cnhpeq/location/L4VWQKEDAHVN1/services","squareWidget":"https://app.squareup.com/appointments/buyer/widget/qbvq4uh8cnhpeq/L4VWQKEDAHVN1","manage":"https://book.squareup.com/appointments/qbvq4uh8cnhpeq/location/L4VWQKEDAHVN1/services"},"shop":{"home":"https://la-soiree-bridal.square.site/s/shop","sampleSale":"https://la-soiree-bridal.square.site/shop/samplesale/5","veils":"https://la-soiree-bridal.square.site/shop/veils/CFS5YS4CJQJT6U6DE2XLQPX2","accessories":"https://la-soiree-bridal.square.site/shop/accessories/3"},"social":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/lasoireebridal/","instagramHandle":"@lasoireebridal","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/La-Soir%C3%A9e-Bridal-105758525447493","pinterest":"https://www.pinterest.com/LaSoireeBridal/","tiktok":"https://www.tiktok.com/@lasoireebridal"},"ga4":"G-DSSRN1351Q"},"content/settings/faq.json":{"groups":[{"group":"Appointments","id":"appointments","items":[{"q":"Do I need an appointment?","a":"Yes. The boutique is open by appointment only, so your stylist’s attention is entirely yours. Appointments run from one to two hours."},{"q":"Which appointment should I book?","a":"The **One-Hour** ($25) suits brides who already know what they love. The **Two-Hour** ($50) gives you time to try every silhouette. The **Champagne VIP** ($125) reserves the entire boutique for two hours, with champagne for you and up to 6 guests."},{"q":"How many guests can I bring?","a":"Up to 4 guests for a standard appointment and up to 6 for a VIP appointment. We kindly ask that no children under 12 attend."},{"q":"Do I choose the gowns I try on?","a":"Yes. You’ll choose roughly 8–12 gowns from the showroom, and your stylist will add a few she thinks you shouldn’t miss."},{"q":"What should I bring?","a":"Nude or skin-tone undergarments (silicone nipple covers, high-waisted shapewear or underwear) — your stylist will help you in and out of each gown. Bring the people whose opinion you trust, and an open mind; brides are often surprised by the silhouette they choose."},{"q":"Can I come back for a second look?","a":"Of course. Book the complimentary 30-minute Return Visit for a second look, to place your order, or to collect your gown."}]},{"group":"Gowns & Sizing","id":"gowns","items":[{"q":"What do your gowns cost?","a":"Gowns range from $1,500 to $6,000, with most between $2,500 and $3,000."},{"q":"How does bridal sizing work?","a":"Bridal sizing runs about two sizes smaller than street sizing — if you usually wear a 6, expect a bridal 10 or larger. Every designer sizes differently, and your stylist will measure you to order the right size."},{"q":"What size are the boutique samples?","a":"Most of our samples are sizes 10–16."},{"q":"Do you carry plus sizes?","a":"Yes. Eva Lendel, Luce Sposa and our Soirée collection are available in plus sizes."}]},{"group":"Ordering","id":"ordering","items":[{"q":"When should I start shopping?","a":"Nine to twelve months before your wedding. Most gowns are made to order — the designer begins your gown once you place the order — and you’ll want time for alterations afterwards."},{"q":"Is my gown made to measure?","a":"Most gowns are made to order, not made to measure: they’re produced in a standard size and then tailored to you by a seamstress."}]},{"group":"Alterations","id":"alterations","items":[{"q":"Will my gown need alterations?","a":"Almost certainly. Very few gowns fit perfectly on arrival. Allow an additional 2–3 months for alterations."},{"q":"Do you offer alterations?","a":"We don’t offer in-house alterations, but we’re happy to recommend trusted seamstresses in the area."}]},{"group":"Payment","id":"payment","items":[{"q":"What is your payment policy?","a":"Payment is made in full when you place your order."},{"q":"What is your refund policy?","a":"All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges. You’ll review and sign a sales agreement when you order."}]},{"group":"VIP","id":"vip","items":[{"q":"What is a VIP appointment?","a":"Two hours with the entire boutique reserved for you and up to 6 guests, with champagne. It is $125 and is booked like any other appointment."},{"q":"Can I book a private appointment?","a":"Yes — the Champagne VIP is our private appointment. No other bride shops while you’re here."}]}]},"content/settings/navigation.json":{"header":{"left":[{"label":"Collection","href":"/collection/"},{"label":"Designers","href":"/designers/"},{"label":"The Experience","href":"/experience/"}],"right":[{"label":"VIP","href":"/vip/"},{"label":"About","href":"/about/"},{"label":"Journal","href":"/journal/"}],"cta":{"label":"Book","href":"/book/"},"menuCtaLabel":"Book an appointment"},"menu":{"before":[{"label":"Home","href":"/"}],"after":[{"label":"Shop","href":"/online-boutique/"}]},"footer":{"tagline":"A private bridal salon for curated European gowns. Richland, Michigan — minutes from Kalamazoo, about an hour from Grand Rapids.","columns":[{"title":"Explore","links":[{"label":"The Collection","href":"/collection/"},{"label":"Designers","href":"/designers/"},{"label":"The Experience","href":"/experience/"},{"label":"VIP Appointments","href":"/vip/"},{"label":"Online Boutique","href":"/online-boutique/"},{"label":"Journal","href":"/journal/"}]},{"title":"Boutique","withContact":true,"links":[{"label":"Book an appointment","href":"/book/"},{"label":"Questions","href":"/faq/"},{"label":"About","href":"/about/"},{"label":"Contact","href":"/contact/"}]}],"legal":[{"label":"Privacy","href":"/privacy/"}],"bottomLine":"© {year} La Soirée Bridal · Bridal boutique serving Kalamazoo & West Michigan"}},"content/settings/routes.json":{"routes":["/collection/","/designers/","/experience/","/vip/","/about/","/journal/","/online-boutique/","/book/","/faq/","/contact/","/privacy/"]},"content/settings/site.json":{"standard":"1.0","sections":["hero-video","statement-split","pillars","collection-rail","designer-index","appointment-feature","vip-teaser","proof","salon-mosaic","journal-teaser","final-cta","rich-text","cta-banner"],"assets":{"siteId":"la-soiree","base":""}},"content/settings/testimonials.json":{"testimonials":[{"quote":"They have super unique gowns you cannot find at other stores.","name":"Tabitha P.","source":"Google review"},{"quote":"She understood everything I was wanting! My party and I felt so comfortable.","name":"Taylor","source":"Google review"},{"quote":"My daughter found her yes dress here. She loved the pampering and the dress choices!","name":"Joann F., mother of the bride","source":"Google review"}]},"content/settings/theme.json":{"colors":{"ivory":"#f7f3ec","cream":"#efe8dd","sand":"#e4d9c8","champagne":"#cdb894","stone":"#b3a58f","muted":"#6b5f52","ink":"#1d1916","charcoal":"#27221e","brass":"#a4835a","brassText":"#7a5e3a"}}}